            "line_count": 3,
            "preview": "// Instant.MIN is the earliest representable moment — always in the past, so elapsed time >= 0 Duration sinceMin = DurationUtils.since(Instant.MIN); assertTrue(sinceMin.compareTo(Duration.ZERO) >= 0);"
